From fb6e495ba77fa15ec42dca29067c3158c6447db4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Igor Grinberg <igrinberg@habana.ai>
Date: Wed, 18 Dec 2019 16:50:33 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] [SW-0] pll: remove no more used w/a code

We do not have anymore old Gaudi SoCs, only the "fixed" ones remain.
Therefore we no longer need the PLL clock switch glitch W/A.
Remove the unused PLL clock switch W/A code.

Change-Id: Ifc0be7b8ddcb3d6538bd3359bc4854ee55934ac6
Signed-off-by: Igor Grinberg <igrinberg@habana.ai>
---

